  "rationale": "Add checked named constrained projection of numerical optimization results while retaining free-coordinate gradients, dimensions, termination and failures. Add explicit fixed-design normal, Bernoulli-logit and Poisson-log batch factors with typed responses, offsets and compensated reductions. Graph expression counts expose bounded batch construction. No finite-estimator, covariance, Enzyme batch-export or sampler/default guarantee is added.",
